      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEET ME AT THE BAR (3) is close to a win. Below best last time when seventh over 1300m at this track on July 29. Freshened and back in trip. Has started four times for the new yard and placed twice with both minors being the sharper trips. Tricky gate but best form stacks up and expected to go close. SAXON BEACH (5) finished out of the placings latest when sixth over 1300m at Katherine but has a senior go aboard this time. Has managed four minor placings from five runs at this circuit. Should be in the finish. MILK FOAM (6) finished third last start over 1000m at Katherine, beaten 11 lengths. Capable of giving a great sight. MACAVERTY (2) finished 12 lengths from the winner in fifth at his most recent outing over 1000m at Katherine after he gave away a big start. Best run for this new yard has been this trip here. Likely to be thereabouts. OPULENT OSCAR (4) was fourth at Katherine last time but rates well on the start here prior.",
